- A: DWARF and .comment orphans were dropped;
- B: duplicate orphans became one output section per input fragment
  instead of one merged section;
- C: __start_/__stop_ symbols were not defined for C-identifier
  orphans;
- D: -s did not drop .symtab;
- E: -s --emit-relocs did not keep the symbol table that the relocations
  need.

Test: script_orphans_match_gnu. It passes now and fails on the previous
binary.
