+///
+/// | library definition | common met first  | library met first |
+/// |--------------------|-------------------|-------------------|
+/// | GLOBAL/UNIQUE data | library binds     | library binds     |
+/// | WEAK data          | common stays      | common stays      |
+/// | function, TLS      | common stays      | common stays      |
+///
